{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangyan-e-cd07ad76f177a4469e6e","title":"何定被诛后，孙皓追圣溪事下薛莹狱并徙广州","accounts":[{"id":"zhangyan-a-cd07ad76f177a4469e6e","label":"正文","text":"何定被诛后，孙皓追圣溪事下薛莹狱并徙广州","evidence":["zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0162","role":"追圣溪事治薛莹者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85"]},{"person":"luxun-p0072","role":"下狱徙广州者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85","related_events":[{"event":"luxun-e-o076a","type":"related","evidence":["zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85","luxun-e-o076a-q"]}],"order":9542},{"id":"luxun-e-o076a","title":"薛莹被征下狱陆抗疏请赦莹召楼玄","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-o076a-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"薛莹被征下狱陆抗疏请赦莹召楼玄","evidence":["luxun-e-o076a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0072","role":"被捕","evidence":["luxun-e-o076a-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0048","role":"上疏请赦","evidence":["luxun-e-o076a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"薛莹被征下狱时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-o076a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o076a-q","source_order":[58,379,"O076a"],"related_events":[{"event":"zhangyan-e-cd07ad76f177a4469e6e","type":"related","evidence":["zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85","luxun-e-o076a-q"]}],"order":10401}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0072","name":"薛莹","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0162","name":"孙皓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o076a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-11441c73cfeb9b85407b","layer":"original","quote":"闻武昌左部督薛莹，征下狱〖1〗，抗上疏曰：“夫俊乂者〖2〗，国家之良宝，社稷之贵资；庶政所以伦叙〖3〗，四门所以穆清也〖4〗。故大司农楼玄、散骑中常侍王蕃、少府李勖〖5〗，皆当世秀颖，一时显器；既蒙初宠，从容列位〖6〗；而并旋受诛殛，或圮族替祀〖7〗，或投弃荒裔。盖《周礼》有赦贤之辟〖8〗，《春秋》有宥善之义〖9〗。《书》曰：‘与其杀不辜〖10〗，宁失不经〖11〗。’而蕃等罪名未定，大辟已加〖12〗；心经忠义，身被极刑：岂不痛哉！且已死之刑〖13〗，固无所识〖14〗；至乃焚烁流漂，弃之水滨：惧非先王之正典，或甫侯之所戒也〖15〗。是以百姓哀耸，士民同戚。蕃、勖永已，悔亦靡及〖16〗；诚望陛下，赦召玄出。而顷闻薛莹，猝见逮录〖17〗。莹父综，纳言先帝〖18〗，傅弼文皇〖19〗。及莹承基，内厉名行；今之所坐〖20〗，罪在可宥。臣惧有司，未详其事；如复诛戮，益失民望。乞垂天恩，原赦莹罪；哀矜庶狱〖21〗，清澄刑网〖22〗。则天下幸甚！”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":421},{"id":"zhangyan-q-63355989643c76800a85","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"后定被诛，皓追圣溪事，下莹狱，徙广州","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":51,"end":69}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
